;; Test scenarios for lorekeeper plugin
;; Each scenario tests that a command/skill produces expected output
;;
;; NOTE: Debug output testing via KNOWLEDGE_DEBUG is available for manual debugging
;; but not used in automated tests since Claude's response to system message
;; instructions is non-deterministic. If deeper debugging is needed, consider
;; implementing file-based logging in the hook (write to a log file that tests can check).

