 {:name "command-adr-new-local-home-by-blast-radius"
  :prompt "/lore:adr The backend keeps its own read model for device status in a separate Postgres schema, rebuilt from domain events. Interview answers: the governed repo is backend; it affects only this repo; undoing it later means migrating the schema and rewriting every device query, weeks of work (one-way); it governs src/Application/Devices/** and src/Infrastructure/ReadModel/**; no security, privacy, billing, legal or contract sensitivity; the alternatives were querying the write tables directly and an in-process cache. Do not ask me questions. Stop after presenting the draft: do not write files, branch, or open a PR."
  :workdir "."
